            "body": "### Checks\n\n- [x] I have checked that this issue has not already been reported.\n- [x] I have confirmed this bug exists on the [latest version](https://pypi.org/project/polars/) of Polars.\n\n### Reproducible example\n\nThe below is run with `uv run --script script.py` and requires miniserve 0.29.0 on path `cargo install miniserve --version 0.29.0 --locked`. Tested on miniserve 0.35.0 as well\n\n```python\n# /// script\n# requires-python = \">=3.11\"\n# dependencies = [\n#     \"polars==1.42.1\",\n# ]\n# ///\n# Requires miniserve 0.29.0: cargo install miniserve --version 0.29.0 --locked\n\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom socket import socket\nfrom subprocess import DEVNULL, Popen\nfrom tempfile import TemporaryDirectory\nfrom time import sleep\n\nimport polars as pl\n\n# pl.show_versions()\n\nwith TemporaryDirectory() as directory:\n    root = Path(directory)\n    for name, rows in [('small', 3), ('large', 1_000_000)]:\n        path = root / f'{name}.parquet'\n        pl.DataFrame({'value': range(rows)}).write_parquet(path, compression='uncompressed')\n        # print(f'{name}: {path.stat().st_size:,} bytes', flush=True)\n\n    with socket() as sock:\n        sock.bind(('127.0.0.1', 0))\n        port = sock.getsockname()[1]\n\n    server = Popen(\n        ['miniserve', '--interfaces', '127.0.0.1', '--port', str(port), directory],\n        stdout=DEVNULL,\n        stderr=DEVNULL,\n    )\n    try:\n        sleep(0.5)\n        for name in ('small', 'large'):\n            url = f'http://127.0.0.1:{port}/{name}.parquet'\n            try:\n                result = pl.read_parquet(url).select(pl.len())\n                print(f'{name}: {result.item():,} rows', flush=True)\n            except OSError as error:\n                print(f'{name}: {error}', flush=True)\n    finally:\n        server.kill()\n        server.wait()\n```\n\n\n### Log output\n\n```shell\nfor just the small file read:\n\n\n_init_credential_provider_builder(): credential_provider_in